<title>UK: Syrian Light Jan crude down 30 cts from Dec-trade.</title>
<headline>Syrian Light Jan crude down 30 cts from Dec-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian Light crude liftings for January have been agreed at Dated Brent -35 cents, down some 30 cents from the December level, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said Souedie January liftings have been agreed at dated Brent -$4.75, unchanged from December.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
